title: "LiDARSimGPU: GPU-accelerated forest voxelisation and LiDAR simulation"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch reimplementation of the slidaRtools voxel-forest and Beer-Lambert
  LiDAR-simulation routines, fully vectorised for GPU execution.
